erent full model's validation predictions. This turn uses `temporal_validation.load` to match both experts,100/80epochs, all3honest outer origin blocks. Corrected prediction-graph control last/middle/first **13.3468183475 /13.0742951214 /13.3844295053**. The first attempted script stopped on a diagnostic-only missing `q['no']` key; repaired and reran the first block, without a submission failure.\n\nStructural graph comparisons, always refitting the history-trend gate and honest shallow residual stage:\n- Block-centered pooled correlation **13.3442144209 /13.0693675978 /13.3678178879**: all improve.\n- Minimum block correlation **13.3522154530 /13.0629738916 /13.3827860818**: mixed, reject.\n- Mean-minus-block-standard-deviation confidence **13.3476882075 /13.0648117542 /13.3692184528**: mixed, reject.\n- Confidence graph blended with history using squared stable/mean support **13.3438690523 /13.0632179384 /13.3728483300**: all improve, reserve.\n- Within-horizon innovation-change correlation **13.3398908846 /13.0701011667 /13.3648759898**: all improve, reserve.\n- **Median across3origin-block innovation correlations 13.3444434054 /13.0664776525 /13.3601791698**: best block-average13.2570334092, candidate.\n\nImplemented `network_diffusion='prediction_median'`: preserve seasonal forecast projection and pooled sensor scaling, but estimate correlations independently within each OOF origin block and select eight neighbors by their median correlation. Full implementation calibration **13.3444438985 /13.0664776292 /13.3601041553**; neighbors identical to prototype, network maxdiff below5e-7. Small differences alter a few residual-tree splits (first maximum final difference .926) but leave all-block gains intact; do not claim exact prediction equivalence. Public candidate evaluation and local seed43runtime/reload started20:19UTC. Retain only if complete protected MAE beats the unchanged baseline. Scripts/caches `/tmp/edge_turn_{validation,implementation_check,runtime}.py`